# #261: light and dark themes. The selector previews live, Escape gives the
# old one back, Enter keeps and SAVES it — it survives a restart. `tone` is
# the body's painted background by luminance, after the CSS variables land.
start
expect-dom tone dark
key alt+9
expect-dom-has open theme
# default → catppuccin-mocha → gruvbox-dark → nord → gruvbox-light
key Down Down Down Down
expect-dom tone light
shot preview
key Escape
expect-dom tone dark
key alt+9
key Down Down Down Down Return
expect-dom-lacks open theme
expect-dom tone light
shot light
restart
expect-dom tone light
# And back: the cursor opens on the current one.
key alt+9
key Up Up Up Up Return
expect-dom tone dark
